{"id":"a39964177c0e0048","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-pspace-complete.md","title":"PSPACE Hardness and Completeness","display":"df-pspace-complete — PSPACE Hardness and Completeness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-pspace-complete","aliases":["28-df-pspace-complete"],"display":"df-pspace-complete — PSPACE Hardness and Completeness","depends_on":["[[28-df-pspace]]","[[28-df-poly-reduction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-pspace-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-pspace-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pspace-complete — PSPACE Hardness and Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd829148f31abddc\" href=\"?note=fd829148f31abddc\" title=\"28-df-pspace\">28-df-pspace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>下文引入语言集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PSPACEHard}\">\\(\\mathrm{PSPACEHard}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PSPACEComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{PSPACEComplete}\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fd829148f31abddc\" href=\"?note=fd829148f31abddc\" title=\"28-df-pspace\">28-df-pspace</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PSPACEHard}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\;L\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}B\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PSPACEComplete}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\cap\\mathrm{PSPACEHard}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PSPACEHard}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\;L\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}B\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PSPACEComplete}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\cap\\mathrm{PSPACEHard}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PSPACE 完全性使用多项式时间多一归约，归约不能直接使用 PSPACE 计算资源。补建可复用的完整性接口，使 TQBF 定理不再仅以未定义的术语命名。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义4.9；印刷83页；PDF109页。陈述已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"fd829148f31abddc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-poly-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"14088421136f8182","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"fd829148f31abddc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{PSPACE}$ 见 [[28-df-pspace]]，$\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}$ 见 [[28-df-poly-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-poly-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"14088421136f8182","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{PSPACE}$ 见 [[28-df-pspace]]，$\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}$ 见 [[28-df-poly-reduction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PSPACEHard}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PSPACEComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PSPACEHard}&\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\;L\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}B\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PSPACEComplete}&\\coloneqq\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\cap\\mathrm{PSPACEHard}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1088,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-207","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"计算模型与空间归约接口：[[28-df-machine-resources]]、[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]、[[28-df-pspace-complete]]、[[28-thm-space-time-relations]]、[[28-thm-logspace-reduction-properties]]。"},{"id":"ed20d679e3199320","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["fd829148f31abddc","14088421136f8182"]}